{"sections":[{"slug":"Levi-Civita联络","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Levi-Civita联络"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Levi-Civita <span lang=\"zh\">联络</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Levi-Civita 联络”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Riemann <span lang=\"zh\">流形的切丛上存在唯一的联络</span> $\\nabla$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\nabla g = 0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">度量相容性</span>);</li>\n<li>$\\nabla_X Y - \\nabla_Y X - [X,Y]=0$ (<span lang=\"zh\">无</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/挠","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">挠率</span>"}},{"Plain":", torsion-free).</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}}]}